  id: solphyre
  dexNumber: 182
  displayName: Solphyre
  lore: The sun-bird of the Sunscour. It burns down to a single ember every dusk
    and is whole again by dawn, and the dunes are said to be the ash of all its yesterdays.
  personality: Radiant, proud, impossible to look at for long.
